title: "The Nerd Codex"
abstract: >-
  A conduct codex for autonomous AI coding agents, skinned as the hacker ethic —
  four disciplines (Leave It Hackable, Read the Source, No Cargo Cult, Finish the
  Hack), each rule carrying an observable falsifier. Part of a small family of
  conduct harnesses.
